        "tree_id": "8be9b2d3ade65a7139a45ec9084eea496fc7c2a1",
        "message": "ci(ios): run testflight checks on ubuntu and gate macos builds\n\nThe full flutter test suite on 2-core macOS runners took ~45 minutes and\nfailed with ~50 platform-dependent failures on every dispatch, so each\nTestFlight run burned ~47 minutes before going red. Move pub get +\nanalyze + test to an ubuntu flutter-checks job and make the three macOS\njobs needs-gate on it; they now only resolve dependencies and build.\nAlso exclude build/** from the analyzer (vendored plugin sources copied\ninto build/ios/SourcePackages produced 83 false analyze errors in\nbuild-upload) and add a cancel-in-progress concurrency group so\nback-to-back dispatches stop queueing zombie runs.",
        "timestamp": "2026-09-20T10:48:38Z",
